				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5929</guid>
				<title>SCP-5929</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5929</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-XXXX&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Clearance Level:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #008080&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c1/Voodoo_doll.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;Voodoo_doll.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-XXXX&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Containment Class:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #228b22&quot;&gt;Safe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Disruption Class:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #228b22&quot;&gt;Dark&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Risk Class:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #ffa500&quot;&gt;Danger&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-XXXX-1 is to be kept in a locker at Site-19. Requests to use SCP-XXXX-1 for &lt;strong&gt;testing purposes only&lt;/strong&gt; must be accepted / denied by personnel with a &lt;span style=&quot;color: #ffa500&quot;&gt;Level 4&lt;/span&gt; Clearance or higher. Any object made by SCP-XXXX-3 should be incinerated if possible&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-XXXX-1 is a brown doll. On SCP-XXXX-1 is purple clothing, a golden harness and a black mask with feathers on top of it. The exact details of the clothing and mask vary slightly between different people. When SCP-XXXX-1 comes in contact with human skin or blood, SCP-XXXX-2 manifests next to SCP-XXXX’s mask. SCP-XXXX-2 is a pill, similar in appearance to &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-500&quot;&gt;SCP-500&lt;/a&gt;. When SCP-XXXX-2 is consumed orally, SCP-XXXX-1 will shake vigorously until it’s mask falls off, revealing a black liquid&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-60784-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;. When SCP-XXXX-3 touches a physical object, it usually turns into a different material however there are cases where the material disappears entirely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Log:&lt;/strong&gt; Current record of test regarding SCP-XXXX-3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject(s):&lt;/strong&gt; One (1) wooden chair&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; One (1) stone chair&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject(s):&lt;/strong&gt; Two (2) wooden chairs&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; Only one (1) of the subjects changed into a stone chair; second subject incinerated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject(s):&lt;/strong&gt; One (1) wooden bowl; filled with fresh water&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; One (1) stone bowl; filled with salt water&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject(s):&lt;/strong&gt; One (1) human cadaver&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; One (1) alive chimpanzee; subject terminated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject(s):&lt;/strong&gt; D-9821&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; Subject disappeared.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject(s):&lt;/strong&gt; D-12908&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; Pile of bones, skin and blood&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject(s):&lt;/strong&gt; One (1) origami crane&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; One (1) crumpled piece of origami paper; subject incinerated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject(s):&lt;/strong&gt; One (1) piece of bread&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; Two (2) pieces of bread; both subjects incinerated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject(s):&lt;/strong&gt; One (1) litre of human blood&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; One (1) litre of fresh water&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject(s):&lt;/strong&gt; One (1) gallon of human blood&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-009&quot;&gt;One (1) cubic object, — appearance similar to an ice cube with a red hue; subject incinerated&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject(s):&lt;/strong&gt; Printed copy for &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4999&quot;&gt;SCP-4999’s file&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; One (1) human cadaver; subject incinerated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject(s):&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-XXXX-1&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; No effect&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject(s):&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-500&quot;&gt;One (1) instance of SCP-500&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; Denied; what would happen iff not the odd event it disappeared?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject(s):&lt;/strong&gt; Fur from one (1) cocker spaniel&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Result:&lt;/strong&gt; Fur from an unknown species; subject terminated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Testing is to continue until further notice&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thekidnamedcover&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7141604&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608694749&quot; alt=&quot;TheKidNamedCover&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7141604)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thekidnamedcover&quot;  &gt;TheKidNamedCover&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-60784-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. SCP-XXXX-3&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
