					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: center;"></div> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-XXXX<br /> <strong>Clearance Level:</strong> <span style="color: #008080">2</span></p> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c1/Voodoo_doll.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="Voodoo_doll.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>SCP-XXXX</p> </div> </div> <hr /> <p><strong>Containment Class:</strong> <span style="color: #228b22">Safe</span><br /> <strong>Disruption Class:</strong> <span style="color: #228b22">Dark</span><br /> <strong>Risk Class:</strong> <span style="color: #ffa500">Danger</span></p> <hr /> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-XXXX-1 is to be kept in a locker at Site-19. Requests to use SCP-XXXX-1 for <strong>testing purposes only</strong> must be accepted / denied by personnel with a <span style="color: #ffa500">Level 4</span> Clearance or higher. Any object made by SCP-XXXX-3 should be incinerated if possible</p> <hr /> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-XXXX-1 is a brown doll. On SCP-XXXX-1 is purple clothing, a golden harness and a black mask with feathers on top of it. The exact details of the clothing and mask vary slightly between different people. When SCP-XXXX-1 comes in contact with human skin or blood, SCP-XXXX-2 manifests next to SCP-XXXX’s mask. SCP-XXXX-2 is a pill, similar in appearance to <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-500">SCP-500</a>. When SCP-XXXX-2 is consumed orally, SCP-XXXX-1 will shake vigorously until it’s mask falls off, revealing a black liquid<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-671136-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup>. When SCP-XXXX-3 touches a physical object, it usually turns into a different material however there are cases where the material disappears entirely.</p> <hr /> <p><strong>Test Log:</strong> Current record of test regarding SCP-XXXX-3</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> One (1) wooden chair<br /> <strong>Result:</strong> One (1) stone chair</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> Two (2) wooden chairs<br /> <strong>Result:</strong> Only one (1) of the subjects changed into a stone chair; second subject incinerated</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> One (1) wooden bowl; filled with fresh water<br /> <strong>Result:</strong> One (1) stone bowl; filled with salt water</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> One (1) human cadaver<br /> <strong>Result:</strong> One (1) alive chimpanzee; subject terminated</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> D-9821<br /> <strong>Result:</strong> Subject disappeared.</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> D-12908<br /> <strong>Result:</strong> Pile of bones, skin and blood</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> One (1) origami crane<br /> <strong>Result:</strong> One (1) crumpled piece of origami paper; subject incinerated</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> One (1) piece of bread<br /> <strong>Result:</strong> Two (2) pieces of bread; both subjects incinerated</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> One (1) litre of human blood<br /> <strong>Result:</strong> One (1) litre of fresh water</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> One (1) gallon of human blood<br /> <strong>Result:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-009">One (1) cubic object, — appearance similar to an ice cube with a red hue; subject incinerated</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> Printed copy for <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4999">SCP-4999’s file</a><br /> <strong>Result:</strong> One (1) human cadaver; subject incinerated</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> SCP-XXXX-1<br /> <strong>Result:</strong> No effect</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-500">One (1) instance of SCP-500</a><br /> <strong>Result:</strong> Denied; what would happen iff not the odd event it disappeared?</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject(s):</strong> Fur from one (1) cocker spaniel<br /> <strong>Result:</strong> Fur from an unknown species; subject terminated</p> </blockquote> <p>Testing is to continue until further notice</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thekidnamedcover" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7141604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608694749" alt="TheKidNamedCover" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7141604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thekidnamedcover" >TheKidNamedCover</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-671136-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. SCP-XXXX-3</div> </div> 
				 	]]>
